.TH "TOLLGATE" "8" "Sep 2026" "tollgate-wrt" "TollGate OpenWrt Module"

.SH NAME
.PP
tollgate-upstream-connect - Connect to an upstream WiFi network


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBtollgate upstream connect  [passphrase] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Connect to an upstream WiFi network. Disables the current upstream, preserving it as a known candidate.

.PP
With --json every progress and result object the service sends is printed as one
line of JSON on stdout (JSON Lines) instead of the prose progress lines, and the
process still exits 1 when the result object carries success:false.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for connect


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB-j\fP, \fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output results as JSON


